# Secrets the Worker reads, listed so the "Deploy to Cloudflare" button knows
# to ask for them on its setup screen. Nothing in this file is ever deployed,
# and the values stay empty on purpose: a default here would become every
# one-click install's password.
#
# AUTH_PASSWORD is the password for your console, as plain text. Pick a long
# one you use nowhere else. (The terminal install stores a scrambled bcrypt
# hash instead, AUTH_PASSWORD_HASH; if both are set, the hash wins.)
AUTH_PASSWORD=
